<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Privacy — Morrow</title></head><body><main style="max-width:650px;margin:10vh auto;padding:30px"><a class="wordmark" href="/">morrow</a><h1 style="font-size:58px;margin:65px 0 25px">A little clarity.</h1><p style="line-height:1.9">This website presents Morrow and a collection of interface concepts. The current frontend has no account system, checkout or analytics tracker.</p><p style="line-height:1.9;margin:22px 0">The “Share your idea” form saves a draft file to your own device. Your draft is not uploaded. Inspiration recipes are also downloaded locally. Images and fonts are served with this website.</p><p style="line-height:1.9;margin:22px 0">Links to GitHub take you to a separate service, with its own privacy policy. Application data handling is documented in the Morrow source repository.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="/" style="margin-top:25px">Back to Morrow ↗</a></main></body></html>
